ÿú␀␀␀␀Oş␀␀␀␀«@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀«`␀␀␀␀ÿó␀␀␀␀ÿô␀␀␀␀ÿö␀␀␀␀ÿù␀␀␀ÿû␀␀şÿı␀␀␀ÿ÷ïş ␀␀ÿÿÿ@␀␀␀¯ÿÿ€␀␀␀ÿÿÀ␀␀␀␀ÿò␀␀␀␀␀9“␀␀␀␀␀`␀␀␀ÿ`␀␀ûÿ`␀ÿ0ÿ`ÿ0␀ÿkÿ0␀␀ÿÿ0␀␀␀ÿ€␀␀␀ÿÿ`␀␀ÿ8ÿ`␀ÿ0ÿ`ÿ0␀ÿaß0␀␀ù0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀#␀␀ı␀.ã␀ÿı.ÿã␀ïÿıNÿÿÀïÿÿÿÿÑ␀ïÿÿÿÑ␀␀ïÿÿÑ␀␀␀.ÿÿı␀␀.ÿÿÿı␀.ÿÿÿÿıÿÿÔïÿü␀OÿÑïş0␀OÑ␀î0␀␀A␀␀ ␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀ ␀ı␀ÿ0
ÿ0␀úÿP␀␀øÿ€␀␀ÿÿ°␀␀␀ÿá␀␀␀␀¿ı␀␀␀␀ÿô␀␀␀OıÿÀ␀␀ÿ)ÿP␀ÿPı␀ÿ°␀?ÿñ␀␀Q␀_ö␀␀␀␀ü␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀g␀W␀␀␀öÿó␀␀ŸÿàÿÀ␀ÿâ␀¯ÿ€ÿâ␀ÿÿŸÿó␀␀ÿÿÿô␀␀␀Oÿÿ÷␀␀␀␀¿ÿû␀␀␀␀ÿÿó␀␀␀ÿÿÿÑ␀␀
ÿÿÿÿ°␀ÿÿ¯ÿÿÿÿ ÿş␀ÿĞ␀Ïÿÿâ␀¶@␀µ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Q␀␀␀_Ñ␀␀_ÿÑ␀_ÿÿÑ_ÿÅ0␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀Şè␀␀
ª`␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀␀ÿú␀␀ÿ ␀ÿúÿÿÿ0ÿÿ0␀ÿ0␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	p␀␀␀␀␀␀Ÿ÷␀␀␀␀␀	ÿÿp␀␀␀␀ÿÿ÷␀␀␀ÿıÌÿp␀␀Å␀␀Ö␀û␀␀␀␀`/û␀ ␀ñ?ûßÿ@␀ñ?ıïÿÿ␀ñ?ÿÿÿÿPñ?ÿÿÿù␀
ñ?ÿÿÿ␀ñ?ÿÿú␀ÿñ?ÿÿà␀ÿñ?ÿÿ€ÿÿñ?ÿÿ`ÿÿñ?ÿÿPÿÿñ?ÿÿPÿÿñ?ÿÿÿÿÿÿñÿÿ§{ÿÿĞïÿPÿş␀>ÿPÿâ␀␀ïPş ␀␀␀>ÿÿâ␀␀␀␀ÿş ␀␀␀␀␀?â␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀␀␀<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ai-terminal setup</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#111;--fg:#e6e6e6;--mu:#8a8a8a;--ok:#2ea043;--err:#f85149;--bd:#333}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){:root{--bg:#f4f4f4;--fg:#111;--bd:#ccc}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;padding:16px;font:15px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
h1{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 16px}h2{font-size:15px;margin:24px 0 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bd);padding-bottom:4px}
label{display:block;color:var(--mu);margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--bd);background:transparent;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;border-radius:0}
textarea{min-height:120px}
button{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--fg);background:transparent;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;margin:8px 8px 0 0;border-radius:0}
button.primary{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end}.row>*{flex:1}.row>button{flex:0}
.item{border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px;margin-top:8px}
.msg{margin-top:8px;color:var(--mu);white-space:pre-wrap}.ok{color:var(--ok)}.err{color:var(--err)}
small{color:var(--mu)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>ai-terminal setup</h1>
<div id="status" class="msg">loadingâ€¦</div>

<h2>1. Wi-Fi</h2>
<div class="row">
  <div><label>SSID</label><input id="wifi_ssid" list="ssids" autocomplete="off"><datalist id="ssids"></datalist></div>
  <button onclick="scan()">Scan</button>
</div>
<label>Password</label><input id="wifi_pass" type="password" autocomplete="off">
<button onclick="wifiConnect()">Connect</button>
<div id="wifi_msg" class="msg"></div>

<h2>2. Inference</h2>
<label>Provider</label>
<select id="inf_provider"><option value="openai">OpenAI-compatible (OpenAI, Ollama, vLLM, LiteLLMâ€¦)</option><option value="anthropic">Anthropic</option></select>
<label>Base URL <small>(API root, e.g. https://api.openai.com/v1 Â· http://192.168.1.10:11434/v1 Â· https://api.anthropic.com/v1)</small></label><input id="inf_url">
<label>API key <small>(may be empty for local servers; shown masked once saved)</small></label><input id="inf_key" type="password" autocomplete="off">
<label>Model</label><input id="inf_model">
<label>System prompt <small>(optional, appended to the device prompt)</small></label><textarea id="inf_prompt" style="min-height:70px"></textarea>
<label>Context window <small>(tokens the model accepts, for the status-bar gauge; e.g. 128000, 200000)</small></label><input id="inf_ctx" type="number" min="0" step="1000">
<label>Price per 1M tokens, USD <small>(input / output; leave 0 to show token counts instead of cost)</small></label>
<div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><input id="inf_price_in" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="input"><input id="inf_price_out" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="output"></div>
<button onclick="testInference()">Test</button>
<div id="inf_msg" class="msg"></div>

<h2>3. MCP servers</h2>
<div id="mcp_list"></div>
<button onclick="addMcp()">Add server</button>

<h2>4. SSH hosts</h2>
<div id="ssh_list"></div>
<button onclick="addSsh()">Add host</button>

<h2>5. Chronicle rooms</h2>
<small>Rooms where people and agents post as peers, kept on the hosted chronicle. Sign in with the GitHub account that holds your chronicle account; the badge keeps a refresh token, nothing else. The badge talks to GitHub itself, so it must be on Wi-Fi first; your phone must have internet to approve (the badge's hotspot has none â€” the badge also shows a QR to scan from any network).</small>
<label>Chronicle site</label><input id="ch_site" placeholder="https://chronicle.impire.dev">
<div id="ch_signed" class="msg"></div>
<div id="ch_flow" style="display:none" class="item">
  <div>Open <a id="ch_link" href="https://github.com/login/device" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/login/device</a> on this phone and enter the code</div>
  <div id="ch_code" style="font-size:28px;letter-spacing:3px;margin:8px 0;font-weight:bold"></div>
  <div id="ch_flow_msg" class="msg">waiting for approvalâ€¦</div>
  <button onclick="chCancel()">Cancel</button>
</div>
<button id="ch_login" onclick="chLogin()">Sign in with GitHub</button>
<button id="ch_logout" onclick="chLogout()" style="display:none">Sign out</button>
<div id="ch_accounts" style="display:none">
  <label>Account</label><select id="ch_account"></select>
  <label>Rooms store <small>(the workspace's store, "rooms" unless you named it otherwise)</small></label><input id="ch_store">
  <button onclick="chSaveAccount()">Use this account</button>
  <button onclick="chTest()">Test</button>
</div>
<div id="ch_msg" class="msg"></div>

<h2>6. Device</h2>
<label>Theme</label><select id="ui_theme"><option value="dark">dark</option><option value="light">light</option></select>
<label>Font size</label><select id="ui_font"><option value="small">small</option><option value="medium">medium</option><option value="large">large</option></select>
<label>Default mode</label><select id="ui_mode"><option value="ai">AI</option><option value="ssh">SSH</option><option value="rooms">Rooms (chronicle)</option></select>
<label>Timezone <small>(POSIX TZ for the clock: CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3 Â· GMT0BST,M3.5.0/1,M10.5.0 Â· EST5EDT,M3.2.0,M11.1.0 Â· UTC0)</small></label><input id="ui_tz">

<h2>7. Import / Export</h2>
<small>The JSON below is the full configuration (secrets masked). Paste a configuration and press Import to load it into the form.</small>
<textarea id="json"></textarea>
<button onclick="exportJson()">Export from form</button>
<button onclick="importJson()">Import into form</button>

<h2>8. Save</h2>
<button class="primary" onclick="save(false)">Save</button>
<button onclick="save(true)">Save &amp; reboot</button>
<button onclick="factoryReset()" style="float:right;border-color:var(--err);color:var(--err)">Factory reset</button>
<div id="save_msg" class="msg"></div>

<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
let cfg={version:1,wifi:{},inference:{},mcp_servers:[],ssh_hosts:[],chronicle:{},ui:{}};
const MASK='â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢';
function api(path,body){return fetch(path,body?{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(body)}:{}).then(r=>r.json());}
function esc(s){return (s==null?'':String(s)).replace(/[&<>"]/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));}
function fill(){
  $('wifi_ssid').value=cfg.wifi.ssid||'';$('wifi_pass').value=cfg.wifi.password||'';
  $('inf_provider').value=cfg.inference.provider||'openai';$('inf_url').value=cfg.inference.base_url||'';
  $('inf_key').value=cfg.inference.api_key||'';$('inf_model').value=cfg.inference.model||'';$('inf_prompt').value=cfg.inference.system_prompt||'';$('inf_ctx').value=cfg.inference.context_window||128000;$('inf_price_in').value=cfg.inference.price_in||0;$('inf_price_out').value=cfg.inference.price_out||0;
  $('ch_site').value=(cfg.chronicle&&cfg.chronicle.site)||'https://chronicle.impire.dev';
  chStatus();
  $('ui_theme').value=cfg.ui.theme||'dark';$('ui_font').value=cfg.ui.font_size||'medium';$('ui_mode').value=cfg.ui.default_mode||'ai';$('ui_tz').value=cfg.ui.timezone||'CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3';
  renderMcp();renderSsh();
}
function renderMcp(){
  $('mcp_list').innerHTML=cfg.mcp_servers.map((m,i)=>`<div class="item">
   <label>Name</label><input value="${esc(m.name)}" oninput="cfg.mcp_servers[${i}].name=this.value">
   <label>URL</label><input value="${esc(m.url)}" oninput="cfg.mcp_servers[${i}].url=this.value">
   <div class="row"><div><label>Auth header</label><input value="${esc(m.auth_header||'Authorization')}" oninput="cfg.mcp_servers[${i}].auth_header=this.value"></div>
   <div><label>Auth value <small>(e.g. Bearer â€¦)</small></label><input type="password" value="${esc(m.auth_value)}" oninput="cfg.mcp_servers[${i}].auth_value=this.value"></div></div>
   <label><input type="checkbox" style="width:auto" ${m.enabled!==false?'checked':''} onchange="cfg.mcp_servers[${i}].enabled=this.checked"> enabled</label>
   <button onclick="testMcp(${i})">Connect</button><button onclick="cfg.mcp_servers.splice(${i},1);renderMcp()">Remove</button>
   <div id="mcp_msg${i}" class="msg"></div></div>`).join('');
}
function renderSsh(){
  $('ssh_list').innerHTML=cfg.ssh_hosts.map((h,i)=>`<div class="item">
   <div class="row"><div><label>Name</label><input value="${esc(h.name)}" oninput="cfg.ssh_hosts[${i}].name=this.value"></div>
   <div><label>Host</label><input value="${esc(h.host)}" oninput="cfg.ssh_hosts[${i}].host=this.value"></div>
   <div style="flex:0 0 90px"><label>Port</label><input value="${esc(h.port||22)}" oninput="cfg.ssh_hosts[${i}].port=parseInt(this.value)||22"></div></div>
   <div class="row"><div><label>User</label><input value="${esc(h.user)}" oninput="cfg.ssh_hosts[${i}].user=this.value"></div>
   <div><label>Password</label><input type="password" value="${esc(h.password)}" oninput="cfg.ssh_hosts[${i}].password=this.value"></div></div>
   <button onclick="cfg.ssh_hosts.splice(${i},1);renderSsh()">Remove</button></div>`).join('');
}
function addMcp(){cfg.mcp_servers.push({name:'',url:'',auth_header:'Authorization',auth_value:'',enabled:true});renderMcp();}
function addSsh(){cfg.ssh_hosts.push({name:'',host:'',port:22,user:'',password:''});renderSsh();}
function collect(){
  cfg.wifi={ssid:$('wifi_ssid').value,password:$('wifi_pass').value};
  cfg.inference={provider:$('inf_provider').value,base_url:$('inf_url').value.trim(),api_key:$('inf_key').value,model:$('inf_model').value.trim(),system_prompt:$('inf_prompt').value,context_window:parseInt($('inf_ctx').value)||0,price_in:parseFloat($('inf_price_in').value)||0,price_out:parseFloat($('inf_price_out').value)||0};
  cfg.ui={theme:$('ui_theme').value,font_size:$('ui_font').value,default_mode:$('ui_mode').value,timezone:$('ui_tz').value.trim()};
  cfg.chronicle={site:$('ch_site').value.trim()||'https://chronicle.impire.dev'};  // tokens, account and store are set through /api/chronicle/*
  return cfg;
}
function msg(id,text,cls){const e=$(id);e.textContent=text;e.className='msg '+(cls||'');}
async function load(){
  try{cfg=await api('/api/config');fill();msg('status','connected to device');pollStatus();}
  catch(e){msg('status','could not load configuration: '+e,'err');}
}
async function scan(){
  msg('wifi_msg','scanningâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/wifi/scan');$('ssids').innerHTML=(r.networks||[]).map(n=>`<option value="${esc(n.ssid)}">${esc(n.ssid)} (${n.rssi} dBm${n.secure?', secured':''})</option>`).join('');
    msg('wifi_msg',(r.networks||[]).length+' networks found â€” pick one from the SSID field');}
  catch(e){msg('wifi_msg','scan failed','err');}
}
let pollTimer=null;
async function pollStatus(){
  try{const s=await api('/api/wifi/status');
    let t='Wi-Fi: '+s.state+(s.ssid?' ('+s.ssid+')':'')+(s.ip?' Â· IP '+s.ip+' Â· also reachable at http://'+s.ip+'/':'')+(s.error?' Â· '+s.error:'');
    msg('status',t,s.state==='connected'?'ok':(s.state==='failed'?'err':''));
  }catch(e){}
  clearTimeout(pollTimer);pollTimer=setTimeout(pollStatus,3000);
}
async function wifiConnect(){
  msg('wifi_msg','connectingâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/wifi/connect',{ssid:$('wifi_ssid').value,password:$('wifi_pass').value});
    msg('wifi_msg',r.ok?'connecting â€” the status line above shows the result (keep this page open; the hotspot stays up)':r.error,r.ok?'':'err');}
  catch(e){msg('wifi_msg','request failed','err');}
}
async function testInference(){
  collect();msg('inf_msg','testingâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/inference/test',{inference:cfg.inference});msg('inf_msg',r.ok?'OK: '+(r.reply||''):'error: '+r.error,r.ok?'ok':'err');}
  catch(e){msg('inf_msg','request failed','err');}
}
async function testMcp(i){
  const m=cfg.mcp_servers[i];msg('mcp_msg'+i,'connectingâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/mcp/test',{url:m.url,auth_header:m.auth_header,auth_value:m.auth_value});
    msg('mcp_msg'+i,r.ok?'OK â€” tools: '+(r.tools||[]).join(', '):'error: '+r.error,r.ok?'ok':'err');}
  catch(e){msg('mcp_msg'+i,'request failed','err');}
}
// ---- chronicle rooms
let chTimer=null;
function chRender(s){
  const signed=s.signed_in;
  $('ch_signed').textContent=signed?('signed in as '+s.login+(s.account?' Â· account '+s.account:' Â· no account chosen')+(s.nats_url?' Â· '+s.nats_url:'')+' Â· badge: '+s.connection):(s.state==='pending'?'':'not signed in');
  $('ch_signed').className='msg '+(signed?'ok':'');
  $('ch_login').textContent=signed?'Sign in again':'Sign in with GitHub';
  $('ch_logout').style.display=signed?'':'none';
  $('ch_flow').style.display=s.state==='pending'?'':'none';
  if(s.state==='pending'){$('ch_code').textContent=s.user_code;$('ch_link').href=s.qr_url||s.verification_uri;$('ch_link').textContent=(s.verification_uri||'').replace(/^https?:\/\//,'');$('ch_flow_msg').textContent='waiting for approvalâ€¦ ('+Math.round(s.expires_in/60)+' min left) â€” or scan the QR on the badge';}
  if(s.state==='starting'||s.state==='finishing'){msg('ch_msg',s.state==='starting'?'asking GitHub for a codeâ€¦':'approved â€” asking chronicle for your accountsâ€¦');}
  $('ch_login').disabled=!s.wifi;$('ch_login').title=s.wifi?'':'connect the badge to Wi-Fi first';
  if(s.state==='error'){msg('ch_msg','sign-in failed: '+s.error,'err');}
  const accs=s.accounts||[];
  const show=signed&&(accs.length>0||s.account);
  $('ch_accounts').style.display=show?'':'none';
  if(show){const sel=$('ch_account');const cur=sel.value||s.account;sel.innerHTML=accs.map(a=>`<option value="${esc(a.account)}">${esc(a.account)} (${esc(a.role)})</option>`).join('');
    if(s.account&&!accs.some(a=>a.account===s.account))sel.innerHTML+=`<option value="${esc(s.account)}">${esc(s.account)}</option>`;
    sel.value=cur||s.account;$('ch_store').value=$('ch_store').value||s.store||'rooms';}
  clearTimeout(chTimer);
  if(s.state==='pending'||s.state==='starting'||s.state==='finishing')chTimer=setTimeout(chStatus,s.state==='pending'?3000:1500);
}
async function chStatus(){try{chRender(await api('/api/chronicle/login/status'));}catch(e){}}
async function chLogin(){
  msg('ch_msg','asking GitHub for a codeâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/chronicle/login/start',{site:$('ch_site').value.trim(),refresh_profile:true});
    if(!r.ok){msg('ch_msg','error: '+r.error,'err');return;}
    msg('ch_msg','');chRender(r);}
  catch(e){msg('ch_msg','request failed','err');}
}
async function chCancel(){await api('/api/chronicle/login/cancel',{});chStatus();}
async function chLogout(){if(!confirm('Forget the GitHub sign-in on the badge?'))return;await api('/api/chronicle/logout',{});msg('ch_msg','signed out');chStatus();}
async function chSaveAccount(){const r=await api('/api/chronicle/account',{account:$('ch_account').value,store:$('ch_store').value.trim()||'rooms'});msg('ch_msg',r.ok?'saved':'error: '+r.error,r.ok?'ok':'err');chStatus();}
async function chTest(){msg('ch_msg','connecting to chronicleâ€¦ (up to 30 s)');try{const r=await api('/api/chronicle/test',{});
  msg('ch_msg',r.ok?('OK â€” connected as '+r.principal+' in account '+r.account+(r.ops!==undefined?' Â· '+r.ops+' operations in the rooms store':r.store?' Â· '+r.store:'')):'error: '+r.error,r.ok?'ok':'err');}catch(e){msg('ch_msg','request failed','err');}}
function exportJson(){collect();$('json').value=JSON.stringify(cfg,null,1);}
function importJson(){try{const o=JSON.parse($('json').value);cfg=Object.assign({version:1,wifi:{},inference:{},mcp_servers:[],ssh_hosts:[],chronicle:{},ui:{}},o);fill();msg('save_msg','imported into the form â€” press Save to store it');}catch(e){msg('save_msg','invalid JSON: '+e,'err');}}
async function save(reboot){
  collect();msg('save_msg','savingâ€¦');
  try{const r=await api('/api/config',cfg);
    if(!r.ok){msg('save_msg','error: '+r.error,'err');return;}
    msg('save_msg','saved','ok');
    if(reboot){await api('/api/reboot',{});msg('save_msg','saved â€” rebooting','ok');}
    else{cfg=await api('/api/config');fill();}
  }catch(e){msg('save_msg','request failed','err');}
}
async function factoryReset(){if(!confirm('Erase all settings and reboot into setup?'))return;try{await api('/api/reset',{});msg('save_msg','erased â€” rebooting','ok');}catch(e){}}
load();
</script>
</body>
</html>
